# didousidali@gmail.com account
IMAPAccount didousidali@gmail.com
Host imap.gmail.com
User didousidali@gmail.com
PassCmd "pass didousidali@gmail.com" 
TLSType IMAPS

IMAPStore didousidali@gmail.com-remote
Account didousidali@gmail.com

MaildirStore didousidali@gmail.com-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path /home/sid/.local/share/mail/didousidali@gmail.com/
Inbox /home/sid/.local/share/mail/didousidali@gmail.com/INBOX
# Flatten .

Channel didousidali@gmail.com
Far :didousidali@gmail.com-remote:
Near :didousidali@gmail.com-local:
Patterns * !"[Gmail]/All Mail"
Create Both
SyncState *
MaxMessages 0
ExpireUnread no

